{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31152","headline":"牡丹四首 一 · 薛能","name":"牡丹四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异色禀陶甄，常疑主者偏。\n衆芳殊不类，一笑独奢妍。\n颗折羞含嬾，藂虚隐陷圆。\n亚心堆胜被，美色艳於莲。\n品格如寒食，精光似少年。\n种堪收子子，价合易贤贤。\n迥秀应无妬，奇香称有仙。\n深阴宜映幕，富贵助开筵。\n蜀水争能染，巫山未可怜。\n数难忘次第，立困恋傍边。\n逐日愁风雨，和星祝夜天。\n且从留尽赏，离此便归田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}